# Classes emitted as proxy stubs into crates/shirabe-php-rpc/php/stubs/. One FQCN per
# line; the output path is derived from the FQCN. Every entry must be classified as
# rust-proxy or contract in the classifier report, and stub base classes must precede
# their subclasses.
